    m_Localized: Welcome to #One-Day Game Jam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 955244576
    m_Localized: "This is the beginning of the #One-Day Game Jam channel.\n\n\u2022
      Communicate with your teammates and make the best game you can!\n\u2022 When
      choices appear, select the option you want.\n\u2022 Open the menu from the
      gear icon in the bottom-left corner."
